"replacement_family_id": "chunk-a9e98e128a35", "content": "### 搜索查询构建 - 画像证据深度融合\n\n- Applies when: 任务有约束且用户画像提供品牌偏好、历史搜索线索时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 从用户画像提取最近14天搜索关键词\n  2. 识别关键词中与任务约束匹配的属性描述（功能、规格、场景、工艺、技术规格等）\n  3. 将历史搜索关键词中的具体属性与任务显式约束融合为复合搜索查询\n  4. 品牌偏好作为次要考量，不主导搜索词构建\n- Verify: 验证搜索结果首屏是否出现同时匹配任务约束和用户历史搜索关键词的商品\n- Avoid: 忽略用户画像中的具体搜索历史参数，使用过于通用的搜索词导致目标商品排序靠后", "validation_result": "rewrite_loser", "estimated_effect": -0.011501579441953475, "contribution_rank": null, "notes": null, "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-000-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "e82ebec1a89efa3b5a7e24921ee64629652714512941cfe8f3fe2efb10219f0d", "intervention_id": "online-6f027bfd79ba53d1", "pool_sha256": "692abcce70e1a0e4544cf899e6a5cf5baef63c1048dc1c0e7b859788ee97c54b", "assignment_sha256": "70bdd0d81a0ca873be3639f3afffebce615da781ca206f196523977955bbf71d", "validation_history": [{"proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-000", "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-000-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "e82ebec1a89efa3b5a7e24921ee64629652714512941cfe8f3fe2efb10219f0d", "intervention_id": "online-6f027bfd79ba53d1", "validation_result": "rewrite_loser", "estimated_effect": -0.011501579441953475, "contribution_rank": null, "pool_sha256": "692abcce70e1a0e4544cf899e6a5cf5baef63c1048dc1c0e7b859788ee97c54b", "assignment_sha256": "70bdd0d81a0ca873be3639f3afffebce615da781ca206f196523977955bbf71d"}]}
