{"candidate_id": "online-bbef274e1764d953", "operation": "ADD", "target_chunk_id": null, "source_card_ids": ["failure-train-group-000000116-sample-000000936-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000209-sample-000001680-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000371-sample-000002976-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000415-sample-000003328-full-skill-retry-01"], "failure_mechanism": "当多个候选均满足显式任务要求时，策略未充分利用用户画像中的最近搜索历史进行优先级排序，或在规格选项选择时未优先验证价格约束即选择与历史偏好匹配的选项", "proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-001", "stage": "online", "consolidation_cluster_id": "cluster-bbef274e1764d953", "replacement_family_id": null, "content": "### 候选商品筛选 - 历史行为与预算协同\n\n- Applies when: 多个候选均满足显式任务要求，且用户画像包含最近搜索关键词时，或商品存在多个满足功能需求的规格选项且任务有明确预算约束时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 从用户画像'最近14天搜索关键词'提取具体规格要素\n  2. 优先选择标题或规格选项中包含这些规格要素的商品\n  3. 列出所有满足核心功能需求的规格选项\n  4. 优先筛选价格在预算上限内的选项\n  5. 从符合预算的选项中选择最佳匹配规格\n- Verify: 验证所选商品的关键属性是否与用户画像中的搜索历史关键词高度匹配，同时满足任务显式约束，且所选规格价格不超过预算上限\n- Avoid: 忽略用户画像中具体规格搜索历史，仅依赖价格或商品属性丰富度做决策，或优先匹配历史搜索关键词而选择超出预算的选项", "validation_result": "selected", "estimated_effect": 0.04165411512595054, "contribution_rank": 2, "notes": null, "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-001-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa", "intervention_id": "online-bbef274e1764d953", "pool_sha256": "a6b930a73f63472e8b2857c5201f7d3506f190f3f979aa0f9cd866e61d0ea6c6", "assignment_sha256": "bdd89685e3b8dc32ce83053f06ced513f911fb92212d800ac0291cea758a7c16", "validation_history": [{"proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-000", "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-000-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "e82ebec1a89efa3b5a7e24921ee64629652714512941cfe8f3fe2efb10219f0d", "intervention_id": "online-bbef274e1764d953", "validation_result": "selected", "estimated_effect": 0.07390903