{"candidate_id": "online-bf7be6b73666b096", "operation": "ADD", "target_chunk_id": null, "source_card_ids": ["failure-train-group-000000158-sample-000001272-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000226-sample-000001816-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000260-sample-000002088-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000332-sample-000002664-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000399-sample-000003200-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000571-sample-000004576-full-skill-retry-01"], "failure_mechanism": "规格选项选择时未验证各选项对应的具体价格，或仅匹配单一核心属性而未系统验证选项描述是否覆盖任务全部功能要求，或未验证选项术语与任务描述的精确匹配", "proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-000", "stage": "online", "consolidation_cluster_id": "cluster-bf7be6b73666b096", "replacement_family_id": null, "content": "### 规格选项选择 - 多维度约束验证\n\n- Applies when: 商品存在多个规格选项且各选项对应不同价格，任务有明确价格约束时，或商品存在多个规格选项且均满足部分核心约束时，或任务明确指定门扇数量、款式编号或尺寸要求时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 逐一查看每个规格选项对应的具体价格\n  2. 筛选出满足价格约束的规格选项\n  3. 从任务指令提取全部功能要求\n  4. 逐一检查各规格选项的描述文本，确认是否明确包含所有功能要求\n  5. 从任务指令提取门扇数量、款式编号或尺寸约束关键词\n  6. 在规格选项中优先选择包含相同术语的选项\n  7. 识别商品价格标注为区间值表明不同选项价格不同，依次点击各候选选项查看对应价格\n- Verify: 选择规格后，确认显示的具体价格是否在任务预算范围内，且所选规格选项的描述文本明确包含任务要求的所有功能属性\n- Avoid: 仅基于功能丰富度选择规格，未验证对应价格是否满足预算，或仅匹配单一核心属性而忽略其他功能要求，或仅依赖语义相似性选择选项而忽略术语精确匹配", "validation_result": "non_positive", "estimated_effect": -0.029030536009663967, "contribution_rank": 12, "notes": null, "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-000-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "e82ebec1a89efa3b5a7e24921ee64629652714512941cfe8f3fe2efb10219f0d", "intervention_id": "online-bf7be6b73666b096", "pool_sha256": "692abcce70e1a0e4544cf899e6a5cf5baef63c1048dc1c0e7b859788ee97c54b", "assignment_sha256": "70bdd0d81a0ca873be3639f3afffebce615da781ca206f196523977955bbf71d", "validation_history": [{"proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-000", "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-000-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "e82ebec1a89efa3b5a7e24921ee64629652714512941cfe8f3fe2efb10219f0d", "intervention_id": "online-bf7be6b73666b096", "validation_result": "non_positive", "estimated_effect": -0.029030536009663967, "contribution_rank": 12, "pool_sha256": "692abcce70e1a0e4544cf899e6a5cf5baef63c1048dc1c0e7b859788ee97c54b", "assignment_sha256": "70bdd0d81a0ca873be3639f3afffebce615da781ca206f196523977955bbf71d"}]}
{"candidate_id": "online-43fef639d72271bd", "operation": "ADD", "target_chunk_id": null, "source_card_ids": ["failure-train-group-000000528-sample-000004232-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000587-sample-000004704-full-skill-retry-01"], "failure_mechanism": "任务含赠品要求时，未验证商品是否提供含赠品的规格选项即完成购买，或搜索结果页选择商品时仅关注价格和基础属性，未验证商品是否提供任务要求的特定规格选项，或商品规格选项与任务技术要求不匹配", "proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-000", "stage": "online", "consolidation_cluster_id": "cluster-43fef639d72271bd", "replacement_family_id": null, "content": "### 候选验证 - 详情页规格与任务需求匹配\n\n- Applies when: 任务指令明确要求商品'带赠品'或包含赠品相关描述时，或任务指令包含具体规格要求且搜索结果页无法完整展示所有规格选项时，或任务包含具体技术规格要求且需从多个候选商品中选择时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 进入商品详情页后，检查规格选项列表中是否存在含'赠品'标识的选项\n  2. 若无赠品选项，回退搜索结果页选择其他候选商品\n  3. 搜索词必须包含任务要求的规格关键词\n  4. 优先选择标题或属性中明确提及该规格的商品\n  5. 进入商品详情页后首先确认是否存在任务要求的规格选项，若不存在则回退选择其他商品\n  6. 进入商品详情页后，先完整浏览所有可选规格选项\n  7. 将任务技术要求与可选选项进行语义匹配\n  8. 仅当存在匹配任务技术要求的选项时才继续选择，否则返回搜索结果\n- Verify: 确认所选规格选项名称中包含'赠品'标识，且在商品详情页确认规格选择列表中存在任务要求的规格选项，且选择后价格仍在预算范围内\n- Avoid: 未验证赠品选项即完成购买，或仅关注价格和基础属性就选择商品而未验证是否提供任务要求的特定规格选项，或仅验证价格范围而未确认规格选项是否满足任务技术要求", "validation_result": "non_positive", "estimated_effect": -0.03292912083600022, "contribution_rank": 14, "notes": null, "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-000-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "e82ebec1a89efa3b5a7e24921ee64629652714512941cfe8f3fe2efb10219f0d", "intervention_id": "online-43fef639d72271bd", "pool_sha256": "692abcce70e1a0e4544cf899e6a5cf5baef63c1048dc1c0e7b859788ee97c54b", "assignment_sha256": "70bdd0d81a0ca873be3639f3afffebce615da781ca206f196523977955bbf71d", "validation_history": [{"proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-000", "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-000-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "e82ebec1a89efa3b5a7e24921ee64629652714512941cfe8f3fe2efb10219f0d", "intervention_id": "online-43fef639d72271bd", "validation_result": "non_positive", "estimated_effect": -0.03292912083600022, "contribution_rank": 14, "pool_sha256": "692abcce70e1a0e4544cf899e6a5cf5baef63c1048dc1c0e7b859788ee97c54b", "assignment_sha256": "70bdd0d81a0ca873be3639f3afffebce615da781ca206f196523977955bbf71d"}]}
{"candidate_id": "online-6868822a9e482a75", "operation": "REWRITE", "target_chunk_id": "chunk-1f8d27322e9f", "source_card_ids": ["failure-train-group-000000715-sample-000005728-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000733-sample-000005872-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000744-sample-000005960-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000864-sample-000006920-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000996-sample-000007976-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000001096-sample-000008776-full-skill-retry-01"], "failure_mechanism": "商品详情页规格选择时未精确复制可点击元素的完整选项文本（包括空格、特殊字符），或商品标题与任务要求表面冲突时过早排除商品而未检查规格选项变体", "proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-001", "stage": "online", "consolidation_cluster_id": "cluster-6868822a9e482a75", "replacement_family_id": "chunk-1f8d27322e9f", "content": "### 候选验证 - 规格选项精确匹配与深度检查\n\n- Applies when: 商品详情页存在规格选择轴且需要点击特定规格选项时，或商品标题与任务核心约束表面不一致但商品类别匹配时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 从可点击元素列表中直接复制完整的规格选项文本，包括所有空格和特殊字符\n  2. 使用该完整文本执行点击操作，不自行构造或修改\n  3. 若商品标题与任务要求表面冲突，点击进入详情页检查规格选项是否包含符合要求的变体\n  4. 确认规格选项明确标注符合任务要求的特征后再做购买决策\n- Verify: 点击后规格状态显示'已选择'且 missing_option_axes 中不再包含该规格轴，或确认所选规格选项的关键属性与任务要求一致\n- Avoid: 自行构造选项文本导致格式不匹配，或仅依赖商品标题判断匹配度而未检查规格选项变体", "validation_result": "selected", "estimated_effect": 0.022425922121432726, "contribution_rank": 4, "notes": null, "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-001-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa", "intervention_id": "online-6868822a9e482a75", "pool_sha256": "a6b930a73f63472e8b2857c5201f7d3506f190f3f979aa0f9cd866e61d0ea6c6", "assignment_sha256": "bdd89685e3b8dc32ce83053f06ced513f911fb92212d800ac0291cea758a7c16", "validation_history": [{"proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-001", "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-001-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": 