{"candidate_id": "online-6219af890a10d20b", "operation": "REWRITE", "target_chunk_id": "chunk-a9e98e128a35", "source_card_ids": ["failure-train-group-000000759-sample-000006080-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000783-sample-000006272-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000960-sample-000007688-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000001008-sample-000008072-full-skill-retry-01"], "failure_mechanism": "搜索查询构建时未充分提取用户最近搜索历史中的全部属性关键词（功能、规格、季节等），或过度融合任务未明确要求的品牌偏好", "proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-001", "stage": "online", "consolidation_cluster_id": "cluster-6219af890a10d20b", "replacement_family_id": "chunk-a9e98e128a35", "content": "### 搜索查询构建 - 画像证据完整融合\n\n- Applies when: 任务有约束且用户画像提供品牌偏好、历史搜索线索时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 从用户画像'最近 14 天搜索关键词'中提取所有属性要素（季节、材质、功能、风格、规格数值等）\n  2. 将提取的全部属性词与任务指令中的显式约束组合为复合搜索查询\n  3. 品牌偏好不直接融入搜索词，仅用于搜索结果出现多个匹配候选时的优先级排序\n  4. 仅当任务指令明确要求某品牌时，才将品牌名称融入搜索查询\n- Verify: 验证搜索结果首页是否出现同时匹配任务约束和用户搜索历史关键词的商品，且搜索查询词仅包含任务指令明确提及的属性\n- Avoid: 仅提取部分搜索历史关键词遗漏关键属性，或将任务未明确要求的品牌偏好强行融入搜索词", "validation_result": "selected", "estimated_effect": 0.017630555816839588, "contribution_rank": 5, "notes": null, "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-001-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa", "intervention_id": "online-6219af890a10d20b", "pool_sha256": "a6b930a73f63472e8b2857c5201f7d3506f190f3f979aa0f9cd866e61d0ea6c6", "assignment_sha256": "bdd89685e3b8dc32ce83053f06ced513f911fb92212d800ac0291cea758a7c16", "validation_history": [{"proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-001", "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-001-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa", "intervention_id": "online-6219af890a10d20b", "validation_result": "selected", "estimated_effect": 0.0176305