{"candidate_id": "online-dd4efe7de728c22f", "operation": "REWRITE", "target_chunk_id": "chunk-bbe6cb9408eb", "source_card_ids": ["failure-train-group-000000696-sample-000005576-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000728-sample-000005832-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000000989-sample-000007920-full-skill-retry-01", "failure-train-group-000001266-sample-000010136-full-skill-retry-01"], "failure_mechanism": "候选商品筛选或规格选择时未充分利用用户画像中最近搜索关键词的具体规格要素，或过度依赖商品标题关键词而忽略品牌偏好与商品关键属性的匹配度", "proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-001", "stage": "online", "consolidation_cluster_id": "cluster-dd4efe7de728c22f", "replacement_family_id": "chunk-bbe6cb9408eb", "content": "### 候选商品筛选 - 搜索历史与品牌偏好协同\n\n- Applies when: 多个候选均满足显式任务要求且用户画像包含最近搜索关键词时，或搜索结果返回多个候选商品且任务包含颜色/规格约束且用户画像存在品牌偏好时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 从用户画像'最近 14 天搜索关键词'中提取具体规格要素（数量词、尺寸词、功能特征词等）\n  2. 逐一检查候选商品的可选规格选项标题，优先选择包含这些规格要素的商品\n  3. 从用户画像提取品牌偏好信息，在搜索结果中优先选择关键属性匹配品牌偏好的商品\n  4. 进入商品详情页验证规格选项是否存在与任务要求完全匹配的选项\n- Verify: 验证所选商品的关键属性是否与用户画像中的搜索历史关键词高度匹配，且商品详情页的规格选项中存在与任务颜色/属性要求完全匹配的选项\n- Avoid: 忽略搜索历史关键词仅凭价格或选项顺序做选择，或仅依赖商品标题中的产品类型关键词做筛选忽略关键属性与品牌偏好的匹配度", "validation_result": "non_positive", "estimated_effect": -0.05534849294039658, "contribution_rank": 8, "notes": null, "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-001-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa", "intervention_id": "online-dd4efe7de728c22f", "pool_sha256": "a6b930a73f63472e8b2857c5201f7d3506f190f3f979aa0f9cd866e61d0ea6c6", "assignment_sha256": "bdd89685e3b8dc32ce83053f06ced513f911fb92212d800ac0291cea758a7c16", "validation_history": [{"proposal_checkpoint": "qwen35-4b-round-001", "evaluation_checkpoint": "round-001-checkpoint", "validation_estimator": "paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept", "bare_validation_observations_sha256": "7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa", "intervention_id": 